OL,3,GNEWSAUnauthorised airport car park
OL,4,Agiven three months to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unauthorised car park near Stansted
OL,7,FAirport must shut within three months,
OL,8,Fa planning inspector has ruled.
OL,10,FEarlier this year, a BBC investigation
OL,11,Frevealed New Farm, near Elsenham,
OL,12,FEssex, had expanded by almost
OL,13,Ftwo-thirds despite being served with an
OL,14,Fenforcement notice to cease operating
OL,15,Fby Uttlesford District Council.
OL,17,FAn appeal was made on behalf of the car
OL,18,Fpark operator, requesting a period of
OL,19,Fsix months to wind the site down.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
